# ── Slide sources ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The hand-edited .pptx decks remain the SOURCE OF TRUTH for slide *content*.
# The mN.md render-sources have diverged from the decks, so DO NOT re-render a
# .pptx from its .md — it would silently clobber the PowerPoint edits
# (diff_deck_vs_source.py still lets you compare the two).
# These .md are tracked again (as of 2026-11-16) ONLY for their presenter notes
# (<!-- Notes: ... -->), reworded to read as spoken script delivered to the room.
# Each file carries a DO-NOT-RE-RENDER banner at its top.
# Previously ignored 2026-08-19..2026-11-16; prior tracked state at commit 2b277e2.

# Build spec for slides that were never rendered into any deck. Kept locally —
# it is the only copy of that work — but not published. Last tracked content is
# in history at 2b277e2 if it is ever needed back.
